Beauty, scenery and building words receive negative activations; photography
and digital-imagery words receive positive ones. A few adjacent-token phrases
strengthen these responses, especially 'natural beauty'. Capitalized beauty
words are weaker. The previous token is forgotten at document boundaries.
Unrelated lexical variation is left at a small background value.
