"""Local lexical cues for possession, presentation, and dollar signs.

Noun classes distinguish continuations of my/our/your; an intervening
adjective weakens the response. Punctuation-attached determiner fragments
count too. Smaller rules cover here/below, let-me reasoning, a few Chinese
